[
  {"comment": "Patterns joining copies of bodies to them and scaled copies (mitcad#539). A 10 mm cube at the origin (Sketch1 F1, Extrude1 F2)."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F1", "corner": [0, 0], "width": 10, "height": 10},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 10}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"comment": "Three copies 5 mm apart along X joined to the cube (combine): one 20 x 10 x 10 body (RectangularPattern1, F3)."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "rectangular_pattern",
    "objects": {"type": "bodies", "bodies": ["F2.b0"]},
    "direction1": {"axis": {"type": "origin", "axis": "x"}, "quantity": 3, "distance": 5},
    "distance_type": "spacing", "combine": true}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "RectangularPattern1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "Body1", "volume": 2000,
    "bbox": {"min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [20, 10, 10]}}},
  {"comment": "A scale pattern of that body: one copy half the size about its centre (10, 5, 5) (ScalePattern1, F4)."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "scale_pattern",
    "objects": {"type": "bodies", "bodies": ["F2.b0"]}, "quantity": 2, "scale": 0.5}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "ScalePattern1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 2, "total_volume": 2250}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F4.b0", "volume": 250, "bbox": {"min": [5, 2.5, 2.5], "max": [15, 7.5, 7.5]}}},
  {"comment": "A peg of its own: a 4 mm circle at (30, 0) extruded 2 (Sketch2 F5, Extrude2 F6), 2 along X 10 apart (RectangularPattern2, F7), then that row 2 along Y 10 apart scaled twice (RectangularPattern3, F8): each copy of the row about its own centre, at (30, 10, 1) and (40, 10, 1); 4 pi * 2 * 8 mm3 each."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F5", "center": [30, 0], "diameter": 4},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F5", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 2}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "rectangular_pattern",
    "objects": {"type": "features", "features": ["F6"]},
    "direction1": {"axis": {"type": "origin", "axis": "x"}, "quantity": 2, "distance": 10},
    "distance_type": "spacing", "compute": "identical"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "rectangular_pattern",
    "objects": {"type": "features", "features": ["F7"]},
    "direction1": {"axis": {"type": "origin", "axis": "y"}, "quantity": 2, "distance": 10},
    "distance_type": "spacing", "compute": "identical", "scale": 2}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "RectangularPattern3", "status": "ok", "bodies": 6}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F8.b0", "volume": 201.06192982974676, "center": [30, 10, 1]}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F8.b1", "volume": 201.06192982974676, "center": [40, 10, 1]}},
  {"comment": "A mirror of the peg about the YZ plane scaled to half (Mirror1, F9): its image at (-30, 0) about its own centre (-30, 0, 1)."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "mirror", "objects": {"type": "bodies", "bodies": ["F6.b0"]},
    "plane": {"type": "origin", "plane": "yz"}, "scale": 0.5}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Mirror1", "status": "ok", "body": "F9.b0", "volume": 3.141592653589793,
    "center": [-30, 0, 1]}},
  {"comment": "mitcad#542: the peg 10 along X, twice the size about the origin carried to the copy, (10, 0, 0) (RectangularPattern4, F10): its centre (40, 0, 1) goes to (70, 0, 2)."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "rectangular_pattern",
    "objects": {"type": "bodies", "bodies": ["F6.b0"]},
    "direction1": {"axis": {"type": "origin", "axis": "x"}, "quantity": 2, "distance": 10},
    "distance_type": "spacing", "scale": 2, "scale_center": {"type": "origin"}}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "RectangularPattern4", "status": "ok", "body": "F10.b0",
    "volume": 201.06192982974676, "center": [70, 0, 2]}},
  {"comment": "The peg 3 along X 15 apart without its copy 1 (RectangularPattern5, F11): one copy at x = 60; then that row 2 along Y 20 apart (RectangularPattern6, F12) copies all three, the skipped one too."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "rectangular_pattern",
    "objects": {"type": "features", "features": ["F6"]},
    "direction1": {"axis": {"type": "origin", "axis": "x"}, "quantity": 3, "distance": 15},
    "distance_type": "spacing", "compute": "identical", "skipped_copies": [1]}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "RectangularPattern5", "status": "ok", "bodies": 9, "body": "F11.b0",
    "volume": 25.132741228718345, "center": [60, 0, 1]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "rectangular_pattern",
    "objects": {"type": "features", "features": ["F11"]},
    "direction1": {"axis": {"type": "origin", "axis": "y"}, "quantity": 2, "distance": 20},
    "distance_type": "spacing", "compute": "identical"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "RectangularPattern6", "status": "ok", "bodies": 12, "body": "F12.b1",
    "volume": 25.132741228718345, "center": [45, 20, 1]}}
]
